---
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
---

<section class="about-mission" aria-label="Missão">
  <Container size="narrow">
    <div class="about-mission__card">
      <p class="about-mission__statement">
        A cozinha é minha paixão e adoro passar meu conhecimento! Me sinto muito realizada ensinando e vendo meus
        alunos fazendo seus doces! Tenho certeza que minha missão de vida é <strong>adoçar a vida das pessoas</strong>{' '}
        e <strong>ensinar meus alunos a prosperarem com isto</strong>!
      </p>

      <p class="about-mission__references">
        ENSP (França) • École Ducasse / Sommet Education • Chef de Cozinha – Curitiba/PR •
        Vencedora “Que Seja Doce” (GNT)
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .about-mission {
    padding-block: clamp(var(--space-12), 6vw, var(--space-20));
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 110%, var(--color-brand-soft), transparent 30rem),
      var(--color-surface);
  }

  .about-mission__card {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(var(--space-5), 3vw, var(--space-8));
    padding: clamp(var(--space-6), 4vw, var(--space-10));
    border: 0.0625rem solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface-elevated);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-mission__statement {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-family: var(--font-family-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 2.4vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .about-mission__statement strong {
    color: var(--color-brand-active);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  .about-mission__references {
    max-width: 58rem;
    padding-top: var(--space-5);
    border-top: 0.0625rem solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 39.99rem) {
    .about-mission__card {
      padding: var(--space-6);
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
